      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm looking at the draft for the new painkiller campaign. we want to go big with \"Superior Rapid Action and Patient Comfort\" to really differentiate from the generics. looking at the latest clinical stuff... does the data actually back up a campaign that emphasizes both the fast relief and a better comfort profile than the generic brands? we need to make sure we can lean into this hard. Over to u.",
